NOTE ON SCOPE — this file covers the **code** only.

The benchmark **data** (task specifications, registries, frozen packs, and the
cases, results and reports produced from them) is licensed separately under
CC BY 4.0. See `LICENSE-DATA`.

The L0 kernel this project builds on lives in `core/`. It carries **its own
licence file**, `core/LICENSE`, and is therefore NOT covered by the grant above —
read that file instead.

